            <div class="card role-card js-role-card" data-search="学习者 课程 学员">
              <div class="role-icon" style="background: var(--color-accent-soft); color: var(--color-accent);">
                <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 18 18" fill="none"><path d="M3 4h12v10H3z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"/><path d="M7 8l2 2 4-4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"/></svg>
              </div>
              <div class="fw-semibold mb-1">学习者工作台</div>
              <div class="text-sm text-ink-2">课程学习 / 考试认证 / 证书</div>
              <div class="role-perm">
                <div class="text-xs text-ink-3">权限</div>
                <div class="text-xs text-ink-2">· 课程学习 + 进度</div>
                <div class="text-xs text-ink-2">· 考试认证 + 证书</div>
                <div class="text-xs text-ink-2">· 校友会参与</div>
              </div>
              <div class="flex items-center justify-between mt-3">
                <span class="badge badge-success badge-sm">已认证</span>
                <span class="text-xs text-ink-3">活跃 · 12 次/月</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="section">
          <div class="section-head">
            <span class="eyebrow">专业角色 · 4 个</span>
            <h2 class="section-title">专家 / 协作类工作台</h2>
          </div>
          <div class="grid-3x">
            <div class="card role-card js-role-card" data-search="独立顾问 1v1">
              <div class="role-icon" style="background: var(--color-role-consultant-soft); color: var(--color-role-consultant);">
                <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 18 18" fill="none"><circle cx="6" cy="6" r="2.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"/><circle cx="13" cy="9" r="2" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"/><path d="M2.5 14a3.5 3.5 0 017 0" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
              </div>
              <div class="fw-semibold mb-1">独立顾问工作台</div>
              <div class="text-sm text-ink-2">1v1 答疑 / 专业支持</div>
              <div class="flex items-center justify-between mt-3">
                <span class="badge badge-success badge-sm">已认证</span>
                <span class="text-xs text-ink-3">6 次/月</span>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="card role-card js-role-card" data-search="家庭办公室 服务商">
              <div class="role-icon" style="background: var(--color-trust-soft); color: var(--color-trust);">
                <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 18 18" fill="none"><path d="M9 2L2 6v10h14V6l-7-4z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"/></svg>
              </div>
              <div class="fw-semibold mb-1">家庭办公室工作台</div>
              <div class="text-sm text-ink-2">家办服务 / 客户管理</div>
              <div class="flex items-center justify-between mt-3">
                <span class="badge badge-success badge-sm">已认证</span>
                <span class="text-xs text-ink-3">4 次/月</span>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="card role-card js-role-card" data-search="公益参与者 公益">
              <div class="role-icon" style="background: var(--color-charity-soft); color: var(--color-charity);">
                <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 18 18" fill="none"><path d="M9 14s-5-3.5-5-7a3 3 0 015-2 3 3 0 015 2c0 3.5-5 7-5 7z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
              </div>
              <div class="fw-semibold mb-1">公益参与者工作台</div>
              <div class="text-sm text-ink-2">公益项目 / 捐赠 / 走访</div>
              <div class="flex items-center justify-between mt-3">
                <span class="badge badge-success badge-sm">已认证</span>
                <span class="text-xs text-ink-3">2 次/月</span>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="card role-card js-role-card" data-search="企业代表">
              <div class="role-icon" style="background: var(--color-info-soft); color: var(--color-info);">
                <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 18 18" fill="none"><rect x="2" y="4" width="14" height="11" rx="1" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"/><path d="M2 8h14" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"/></svg>
              </div>
              <div class="fw-semibold mb-1">企业代表工作台</div>
              <div class="text-sm text-ink-2">企业画像 / 服务采购</div>
              <div class="flex items-center justify-between mt-3">
                <span class="badge badge-success badge-sm">已认证</span>
                <span class="text-xs text-ink-3">3 次/月</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="section">
          <div class="section-head">
            <span class="eyebrow">协作角色 · 2 个</span>
            <h2 class="section-title">协作与社区</h2>
          </div>
          <div class="grid-3x">
            <div class="card role-card js-role-card" data-search="协作发起人 协作">
              <div class="role-icon" style="background: var(--color-warn-soft); color: var(--color-warn-2);">
                <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 18 18" fill="none"><path d="M3 14l5-5 3 3 4-4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"/></svg>
              </div>
              <div class="fw-semibold mb-1">协作发起人工作台</div>
              <div class="text-sm text-ink-2">项目协作 / 团队管理</div>
              <div class="flex items-center justify-between mt-3">
                <span class="badge badge-success badge-sm">已认证</span>
                <span class="text-xs text-ink-3">5 次/月</span>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="card role-card js-role-card" data-search="校友会 校友">
              <div class="role-icon" style="background: var(--color-success-soft); color: var(--color-success);">
                <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 18 18" fill="none"><path d="M9 2L4 6v6l5 2 5-2V6l-5-4z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"/></svg>
              </div>
              <div class="fw-semibold mb-1">校友会工作台</div>
              <div class="text-sm text-ink-2">校友活动 / 长期关系</div>
              <div class="flex items-center justify-between mt-3">
                <span class="badge badge-success badge-sm">已认证</span>
                <span class="text-xs text-ink-3">1 次/月</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- AI 建议 -->
        <section class="section">
          <div class="ai-suggestion">
            <div class="ai-suggestion-icon">
              <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 18 18" fill="none"><circle cx="9" cy="9" r="3" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4"/><path d="M9 2v3M9 13v3M2 9h3M13 9h3" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
              <span>AI 团队建议</span>
            </div>
            <div class="ai-suggestion-title">建议切换到 EMP 顾问工作台</div>
            <div class="ai-suggestion-reason">您今天有 2 个 EMP 1v1 答疑待处理（陈丽华 14:00 + 王志远 16:00），当前在「推荐人」工作台无法直接进入 1v1 模式。切换后可一键开始，节省 3 次跳转。</div>
            <div class="ai-suggestion-actions">
              <button class="btn btn-primary btn-sm">切换到 EMP 工作台</button>
              <button class="btn btn-ghost btn-sm">稍后</button>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>
      </div>
    </main>
  </div>
  <script src="../js/app.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
